  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello,\n\nSince several updates, we can actually see the users we have blocked and present in the instance.\n\nBut it would be interesting to be able to see also the players who are connected in the instance but they are the ones who blocked us.\n\nIt would be easier to know if our friends are going crazy and talking to themselves, if there is a bug in VRChat/world that makes me not see the user or if they are talking to someone who has blocked us. The same goes for the different game worlds.\n\nBy the way, it would be interesting to reupdate this feature request that has never been updated since 2018 : https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/more-robust-block-system-notify-users-if-blocked-user-enters-world\n\nThank you very much!\n\nLusiiky",
